    <h1>23 Days Uzbekistan to Pakistan via Karakoram Highway</h1>
    <div class="route">📍 Tashkent &#8594; Samarkand &#8594; Bukhara &#8594; Khiva &#8594; Kashgar &#8594; Hunza &#8594; Gilgit &#8594; Islamabad</div>
    <div class="badge-row"><span>&#127759; Three Countries</span><span>&#128663; Epic Overland</span><span>&#127891; English Guide</span><span>&#9968;&#65039; Karakoram Highway</span></div>
